-- The room Service: `look`, as a Script. mua sends it `look place, actor`
-- for the room the actor is in; what it returns is the actor's reply.
--
-- A world's own room Scripts are offered `look` first (as the receiver
-- with role "room"), so they can replace it or add to it.

use describe from rooms

on look place, actor
  return describe(place, actor)
end look
